Income from finance or operating lease
10C.
—(1)  Despite any other provisions of this Act, the Minister may by regulations provide for the circumstances in which the Comptroller may direct that allowances under section 19, 19A, 20, 21, 22 or 23 in respect of any machinery or plant which is leased under a finance lease entered into on or after 1 April 1990 are not to be made to the lessor but to the lessee as though the machinery or plant had been sold by the lessor to the lessee.
