“approved special purpose vehicle”, in relation to a shipping financing arrangement enterprise, means a company, a partnership or a registered business trust that undertakes or intends to undertake any activity mentioned in paragraph (
a
) or (
b
) of the definition of “shipping financing arrangement enterprise” involving ships or containers controlled and managed by the enterprise, and is approved by the Minister or authorised body to be an approved special purpose vehicle of the enterprise;
“finance leasing” has the meaning given by section 13A(16);
