(1A)  The person (
X
) declared the agent under subsection (1) is the agent of such other person for the purposes of this Act and may be required to pay any tax due from any moneys, including pensions, salary, wages or any other remuneration, which, at the date of the receipt of the notice or at any time during the period of 90 days thereafter, may be held by
X
for or due by
X
