(12)  Without limiting sub‑paragraph (11)(
a
) and (
c
), a main entity or any of its permanent establishments is a qualifying exempt income entity if (and only if) the main entity and all of its permanent establishments satisfy the condition in sub‑paragraph (11)(
b
